    {
      "uri": "#class-business-asset",
      "subClassOf": "#class-anthropogenic-data",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Valeur métier",
        "en": "Business asset"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": {
        "fr": "(source : [EBIOS Risk Manager])\nDans le cadre de l'étude, composante importante pour l'organisation dans l'accomplissement de sa mission. Cela peut être un service, une fonction support, une étape dans un projet et toute information ou savoir-faire associé.\nEx : service d'annulation de réservations en ligne ou de sauvegarde, informations clients, service de supervision, résultats de travaux de R&D, données à caractère personnel, phase de déploiement d'un projet, savoir-faire en conception de pièces aéronautiques.\nSynonyme(s) : bien essentiel, actif primordial, élément à protéger.",
        "en": "(source: [EBIOS Risk Manager])\nIn the framework of the study, an important component for the organisation accomplishing its mission. This can be a service, a support function, a step in a project and any related information or know-how.\nE.g.: on-line back-up or reservation cancellation service, client information, supervision service, results of R&D work, personal data, deployment phase of a project, know-how in designing aeronautical parts."
      },
      "versionInfo": [
        "2026-06-05: Add #class-business-asset",
        "2026-07-07: Add prefix class-, usecases, properties and relations, remove types"
      ],
      "usecases": [
        "Risk management"
      ],
      "properties": [

      ],
      "relations": [
        {
          "uri": "#relation-is-impacted-by",
          "label": {
            "fr": "est impactée par",
            "en": "is impacted by"
          },
          "range": [
            "#class-effect",
            "#class-strategic-scenario"
          ]
        },
        {
          "uri": "#relation-relies-on",
          "label": {
            "fr": "repose sur",
            "en": "relies on"
          },
          "range": [
            "#class-information-system",
            "#class-supporting-asset"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "uri": "#class-actor",
      "subClassOf": "#class-anthropogenic-data",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Acteur",
        "en": "Actor"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": {
        "fr": "(source : [EBIOS Risk Manager])\nElément, personne, groupe de personnes ou organisation susceptible d'engendrer un risque. Une source de risque peut être caractérisée par sa motivation, ses ressources, ses compétences, ses modes opératoires (de prédilection).\nSynonyme(s) : source de risque\nEx : services étatiques, hacktivistes, concurrents, employés vengeurs.",
        "en": "(source: [EBIOS Risk Manager])\nElement, person, group of persons or an organisation that can generate a risk. A risk origin can be characterised by its motivation, its resources, its skills, its preferred methods of attack.\nSynonym(s): risk source\nE.g.: state services, hacktivists, competitors, vengeful employees."
      },
      "versionInfo": [
        "2026-06-05: Add #class-risk-source",
        "2026-07-07: Add prefix class-, usecases, properties and relations, remove types",
        "2026-07-07: Rename #class-risk-source to #class-actor"
